WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.461 --> 00:00:01.621
- You get mixed emotions

00:00:01.621 --> 00:00:03.900
when you're out there
hunting the lionfish.

00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:05.148
A feeling of accomplishment

00:00:05.148 --> 00:00:07.323
because you're actually
making a difference,

00:00:07.323 --> 00:00:10.155
a feeling of competitiveness
because of the fact

00:00:10.155 --> 00:00:14.322
that, in my case, I'm trying
to be Florida's Lionfish King.

00:00:16.095 --> 00:00:20.958
Lionfish are a non-native
species to the Atlantic,

00:00:20.958 --> 00:00:23.256
the Gulf and the Caribbean.

00:00:23.256 --> 00:00:25.813
Because they reproduce at such a high rate

00:00:25.813 --> 00:00:27.396
and have zero predators,

00:00:27.396 --> 00:00:31.268
they are currently taking
over the waters here.

00:00:31.268 --> 00:00:33.516
Lionfish eat basically
everything that we eat,

00:00:33.516 --> 00:00:36.947
which includes crabs,
lobsters, grouper, flounder,

00:00:36.947 --> 00:00:39.369
anything, you name it, they're game.

00:00:39.369 --> 00:00:42.624
The scary part is, is that
we don't know how many

00:00:42.624 --> 00:00:44.761
of them are out there, and
it's probably a lot bigger

00:00:44.761 --> 00:00:46.369
than we ever will know because of the fact

00:00:46.369 --> 00:00:48.285
that we always dive the public spots

00:00:48.285 --> 00:00:50.385
or the private fishermen spots,

00:00:50.385 --> 00:00:52.218
but, I mean, the ocean is huge.

00:00:53.730 --> 00:00:55.617
(water splashing)

00:00:55.617 --> 00:00:57.161
The Lionfish Challenge is a contest set up

00:00:57.161 --> 00:00:59.865
for those of us that are
making a difference to go out

00:00:59.865 --> 00:01:02.305
and kill as many lionfish as we can

00:01:02.305 --> 00:01:03.938
over the next four months.

00:01:03.938 --> 00:01:06.321
(upbeat electronic music)

00:01:06.321 --> 00:01:08.929
Not every person is a big
fan of spearfishing,

00:01:08.929 --> 00:01:11.577
but the problem that we
have with the lionfish,

00:01:11.577 --> 00:01:14.354
these things need to be
eliminated, every one of them,

00:01:14.354 --> 00:01:16.073
and whether you're a big fan of it or not,

00:01:16.073 --> 00:01:17.618
this is just not about spearfishing.

00:01:17.618 --> 00:01:19.553
It's about taking care of our ecosystem

00:01:19.553 --> 00:01:22.097
and making sure that
everything stays balanced.

00:01:22.097 --> 00:01:25.579
(instrumental reggae music)

00:01:25.579 --> 00:01:26.962
Being crowned the Lionfish King

00:01:26.962 --> 00:01:31.737
will be a huge accomplishment,
but it's not just about that.

00:01:31.737 --> 00:01:33.442
The next weekend, I'll probably go out

00:01:33.442 --> 00:01:34.545
and do the same thing again

00:01:34.545 --> 00:01:36.538
even though the competition is over.

00:01:36.538 --> 00:01:40.205
(instrumental reggae music)

